+/**
+ * A validated claim body: a blank date already defaulted to the sheet's today; a negative amount (a correction) with
+ * the number of the claim it corrects, which is null for any other claim.
+ */
+public record ClaimInput(BigDecimal amount, LocalDate date, String note, Integer corrects) {
+
+    public ClaimInput(BigDecimal amount, LocalDate date, String note) {
+        this(amount, date, note, null);
+    }
 
     /** The audit fields of this claim for the named person: amount as the screen shows it, ISO date. */
